        "exact_text": "I am a data scientist, and I have a breast cancer classification project in ml_project/. The baseline model in train_baseline.py uses an SVM with suboptimal hyperparameters — no feature scaling, linear kernel, C=0.001 — achieving only about 90% accuracy on the Wisconsin Breast Cancer dataset with 569 samples and 30 features.\n",
